      "bank_transfers": "Identity verification (KYC/KYB) is strictly bound at the bank account level (IBAN, routing/account number). Sanctions screening (OFAC) and AML transaction monitoring occur inline before fund release.",
      "wallet_transfers": "Transactions are pseudo-anonymous (controlled by public-private key pairs). Compliance layers rely on blockchain intelligence APIs (Chainalysis, Elliptic, TRM Labs) to screen wallet addresses and Travel Rule protocols (e.g., Notabene, Sygna) for VASP-to-VASP transfers."
    },
