      "name": "Coinshift",
      "type": "Treasury Operations Dashboard",
      "description": "An enterprise treasury and financial operations layer built on Safe infrastructure. It aggregates multiple accounts and Safes, enabling mass payouts, financial labeling, and balance consolidation across Layer 2 networks."
