    "treasury_tooling_advantages": "Because Lisk is part of the Optimism Superchain, organizations can use unified EVM treasury software like Safe and Coinshift interchangeably across Lisk, Base, and OP Mainnet, contrasting with fragmented, chain-specific custody protocols."
  }
}

